 "name": "Maculation",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/new-shadow-style.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Moonlight Veil</em></p>\n<p>As an action for up to 6 cursed energy, you create up to 6 smaller Simple Domains on the ground within 30 ft of yourself that each cover a 5 ft space for 1 minute. Each <em>Maculation</em> functions as a Simple Domain with hit points equal to 5 x your proficiency bonus. While standing in a space with <em>Maculation</em>, you can use your reaction to either gain a +3 bonus to AC or reduce incoming damage by your weapon's damage until the beginning of your next turn. A <em>Maculation</em> disappears if you end your turn more than 30 ft away from one.</p>",
